		skos:definition	"This industry includes companies that specialize in discovering, developing and patenting of novel pharmaceuticals. Typically, these companies have high R&D investments, primarily focus on drug discovery/development, and rarely diversify into other verticals. Also, these companies typically pursue high-value/high-risk frontier pharmaceutical targets."@en ;
